glory?" [[Luke 24:25-26]] AH 3, XVI:5, p442 [BKV](https://bkv.unifr.ch/en/works/cpg-1306/versions/against-heresies/divisions/492)

### AH 3, XVI:5 (John reference)

> The Gospel, therefore, knew no other son of man but Him who was of Mary, who
also suffered; and no Christ who flew away from Jesus before the passion; but
